EPSG Geodetic Parameter Dataset
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

crates/terrio-crs/data/epsg.tsv.zst and crates/terrio-crs/data/datums.tsv.zst are derived from the EPSG
Geodetic Parameter Dataset (https://epsg.org), copyright the International Association of Oil &
Gas Producers (IOGP), through PROJ's database and GDAL. They are redistributed under the EPSG
terms of use (https://epsg.org/terms-of-use.html), with this attribution. They are not the EPSG
Dataset itself, and terrio is not endorsed by IOGP.

